# As in the image (00-foil.preset): presets enable nothing in the initrd. 00- sorts before Debian's 90-systemd.preset,
# whose "enable" lines would otherwise win (getty, networkd, pstore, sysext links in /etc/systemd/system, seen in
# mkosi's default initrd and in a 99- variant of this file). What the initrd runs is pulled in by systemd's static
# dependencies (initrd.target) and the symlinks in this tree.
disable *
